			icon: "battery",
			title: "Pull, not Push",
			body: "Nothing is transmitted until somebody subscribes. Camera 7 doesn't touch the Starlink uplink until somebody cares about camera 7.",
		},
		{
			icon: "rocket",
			title: "Shit Networks",
			body: "Every subscription has a priority on one QUIC connection. Controls before audio before telemetry before video—you decide what gives.",
